<h1 class="list-page-heading">Service prologue reconciliation</h1>
<p>
  Per-service view of where each service's port assignments carry per-port prologues.
  Pick a service to see all distinct prologues attached to it across every device, and
  fold them into the service's <code>port-config.txt</code> with a single confirmation.
</p>
<p style="color:#666; font-size:0.9em;">
  In-use services first ({{in_use_count}}), then unused services ({{unused_count}}). The
  <em>Distinct prologues</em> column is the count of unique <code>prologue</code> values
  attached to this service across the fleet — a high number is a strong candidate for cleanup.
</p>
{{> quicksearch}}
<div class="table-scroll">
<table id="{{quicksearch_table_id}}">
<thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Devices</th><th>Ports</th><th>Distinct prologues</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{#rows}}
<tr class="{{#has_fold_candidates}}has-fold-candidates{{/has_fold_candidates}}">
  <td><a href="/reconcile/services/{{name}}">{{name}}</a></td>
  <td>{{device_count}}</td>
  <td>{{port_count}}</td>
  <td class="prologue-count">{{distinct_prologue_count}}</td>
</tr>
{{/rows}}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
{{> colresize}}
